30,2,1,talk,Servas,,"It appears that our reporting is far more cumbersome than I hoped, especially regarding assets that require physical appraisals. It adds significant time and cost to our audits.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
31,2,1,talk,Asuka,,"My findings suggest a discrepancy in our success stories; our most profitable exits were quiet back-office tools, while the write-off involved physical premises and hourly crews. Retention also varies wildly by sector.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
32,2,1,talk,Minako,,"Our reserves are being depleted by follow-on calls at twice the expected rate, and our credit line is unfortunately restrictive, offering little value against subscription contracts.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
33,2,1,talk,Mio,,"It turns out we're great at filling support roles, but finding supervisors or field crews is a nightmare! Also, our software partners are totally swamped with board seats.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,2,1,talk,Toshio,,"I've found that security reviews for medical or financial data can take three times longer than others, and hardware-dependent delivery is far more prone to unexpected delays than pure software.","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,2,2,talk,Servas,,"It seems we are all facing a common theme: the physical world brings complications that the digital one does not, whether in auditing, staffing, or delivery.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,2,talk,Asuka,,I agree. The data on our write-offs and retention suggests that operational complexity in the physical realm is a significant risk factor for our returns.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,2,talk,Minako,,"From a financial perspective, the restrictive nature of our credit line means we cannot rely on subscription-based security to bridge any gaps. We need a model that doesn't drain our reserves prematurely.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,2,talk,Mio,,"Wait, if we can't find field crews and our software partners are already too busy, we should probably avoid anything that needs a lot of manual labor or heavy board oversight!","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,2,talk,Toshio,,"Exactly. If we want to avoid the bottlenecks I discovered, we should be wary of any candidate that relies on hardware deployment or handles sensitive medical records.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,3,talk,Servas,,"It is a rare moment of alignment. We are all seeing the same shadow cast by physical operations and regulatory hurdles. We must prioritize a lean, digital approach.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,3,talk,Asuka,,"If we prioritize lean, digital models, we should look for a candidate that avoids both the high churn of simple shopkeeper tools and the operational drag of physical infrastructure.","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,3,talk,Minako,,"I agree. We need a company that provides stable, recurring value without requiring us to commit excessive capital or manpower to sustain its growth.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,3,talk,Mio,,I'm totally on board! Let's find someone who doesn't need a whole army of field workers or a partner to spend every waking hour on their board.,"{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,3,talk,Toshio,,Then we should be looking for a pure software solution that avoids the security delays of medical data and the volatility of hardware supply chains.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,4,talk,Servas,,It seems we have a clear set of criteria. Let us see which of the candidates fits this profile of low operational drag and high digital stability.,"{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,4,talk,Asuka,,I believe we are ready to review the candidates and apply these filters to ensure we don't repeat past mistakes.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,4,talk,Minako,,I agree. Let's move to the candidates and see which one aligns best with our need for financial stability and minimal operational overhead.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,4,talk,Mio,,I'm so excited to see who made the cut! Let's hope for someone who's easy to support and doesn't need a million new hires right away!,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,4,talk,Toshio,,I am ready. Let us examine the candidates and see which one avoids the pitfalls we have identified.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
